    "identifier": "shakuton-scorch-release-murderous-revitalization",
    "description": "<p>You conjure multiple globes of superheated flame, overwhelming the chakra a hostile creature left behind on an allied creature you touch. Select one condition applied by a hostile creature, reducing its rank by 1.</p>\n<p>Scorch. By spending 1 Scorch Charge, your chakra destroys foreign chakra of your choice all around you. This jutsu’s range, instead becomes Self (10-Feet), affected all creatures in range.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and the number of ranks you can reduce by 1.</p>",
